      "title": "Application for Distribution of Pathogen of Contagious Aquatic Animal Diseases",
      "enforcement_date": "",
      "content": "[별지 제2호서식]\n\nApplication for Distribution of Pathogen of\nContagious Aquatic Animal Diseases\n\n\n\n──────────┬───────┬──────────┬───────────────────\nApplication       │Submission    │Date of Issuance/   │Proceedings   30 days\nNo.               │Date          │Reading             │\n──────────┴───────┴──────────┴───────────────────\n\n───────┬───────────┬─────────────────────────────\nApplicant   │Organization          │Business Registration No.\n├───────────┼─────────────────────────────\n│Name (Representative) │Applicant (title or position)\n│(Last, First, Middle) │\n├───────────┼─────────────────────────────\n│Address               │Applicant contact no.\n───────┼───────────┴─────────────────────────────\nApplication │Strain / Serial no.\nOverview    │                  Ex.: virus / SVC / ADC-SVC2022-01\n├─────────────────────────────────────────\n│Quantity\n├─────────────────────────────────────────\n│Objective                            (Attachment available)\n├─────────────────────────────────────────\n│Contents of Distribution             (Attachment available)\n├─────────────────────────────────────────\n│Institution / Storage / Disposal method\n├─────────────────────────────────────────\n│Manager (department head officer) / User (name, position)\n━━━━━━━┷━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nUnder the Article 12 Clause 1 and 3 of the Law for Aquatic Organism Disease Control Act,\nI would like to apply for distribution of pathogen of aquatic animals disease as stated above.\n\nDate :\n\nApplicant :            (name)\n(Signature or Seal)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n─────────┬──────────────────────────┬────────────\nAttachment      │1. Facility specification                           │No charge\n│2. Research plan & safety plan                      │is imposed\n│3. Pathogen-related project list in the past        │\n│4. Research manpower & related research publication │\n─────────┴──────────────────────────┴────────────\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n210mm×297mm[백상지 80g/㎡]\n",
