      "title": "(Domestic, Overseas) Approval for Distribution of Pathogen of Contagious Aquatic Animal Diseases",
      "enforcement_date": "",
      "content": "[별지 제4호서식]\n\nNO. :         │[ ] Domestic    Approval for Distribution of Pathogen of\n│                Contagious Aquatic Animal Diseases\n│[ ] Overseas\n━━━━━━━━┷━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n──────┬───────────┬────────────────────────────\nApplicant │Organization          │Business Registration No.\n├───────────┼────────────────────────────\n│Name (Representative) │Applicant (title or position)\n│(Last, First, Middle) │\n├───────────┼────────────────────────────\n│Address               │Tel.\n──────┴───────────┴────────────────────────────\nResources Approved to be Distributed\n(Additional papers can be attached, if needed)\n━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━\nSerial      │Resources No.     │Resources name│Distribution Quantity │Note\nNo.         │                  │              │                      │\n───────┼─────────┼───────┼───────────┼─────────\n│                  │              │                      │\n───────┼─────────┼───────┼───────────┼─────────\n│                  │              │                      │\n───────┼─────────┼───────┼───────────┼─────────\n│                  │              │                      │\n───────┴─────────┴───────┴───────────┴─────────\nTerms of Distribution :\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nUnder the Article 12 Clause 1 and 3 of the Law for Aquatic Organism Disease Control Act,\nthe pathogen of contagious aquatic animal diseases requested above are hereby approved to\nbe distributed.\n\n\n\nyear         month       date\n\n┏━━┓\nPresident of National Fishery Products Quality Management ┃직인┃\nService                                                   ┃    ┃\n┗━━┛\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n210mm×297mm[백상지 80g/㎡]\n",
